Exact divisor-sheet theorem
  wall coordinate: 7x=h/d reduced
  exact owners: S_d(A)={a in A:d|a}
  owner-set columns: k mod 7g, g=gcd(S)
  column count: N_A(S)=7 sum_(T subset A\S) (-1)^|T| gcd(g,T)
  parity count: N_eta=7 sum_T (-1)^|T| E_eta(gcd(g,T),t)
  E_0(h,t)=c ceil(delta/2), E_1(h,t)=c floor(delta/2)
  where c=gcd(h,t), delta=h/c
  signed word: sum_k [P_m-( {tk/(7g)} )-P_m+( {tk/(7g)} )]/t
  total swept walls: 954471
  affine K_8,7 fiber checks: 906171

Affine colored K_8,7 fiber
  h=a+jd with a in U_d and j in Z_7
  A_e^+(j)=floor(ea/d)+ej mod 7
  A_e^-(j)=A_e^+(j)-1_[d|e]
  A_2t(j)=2A_t(j)+floor(2{ta/d}) mod 7
  score: pointed rainbow-completion switch, not a crossing count
  reflection: W_S(-k;b)=W_S(k;R(b)), R(b)=-b-1
  actual stationary pin 0 reflects to adjacent pin 6, so no cancellation

